The prior triage is not salvageable as a compliant family. The full paper contains no complexity or distributional-hardness result for endpoint-to-endpoint Pachner path recovery, and its only explicit certificate is Proposition 4.4’s fixed 20-move identity: the paper’s mechanical route and the “compact” route are both exactly those same 20 output moves. Random-walk endpoints would give G and V, but neither Track A evidence nor the efficient-reference/short-insight gap required by Track B.
